### Configuração de Variáveis Globais
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080/v1
@contentType = application/json

###############################################################################
# 1. PAUTAS
###############################################################################

### 1.1 Criar uma Nova Pauta
# @name criarPauta
POST {{baseUrl}}/pautas
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "titulo": "Aprovação do Orçamento Anual 2026",
  "descricao": "Votação para deliberar sobre a aprovação dos custos operacionais e investimentos da cooperativa."
}

### Variável dinâmica capturando o ID da pauta criada acima
@pautaId = {{criarPauta.response.body.id}}


### 1.2 Listar Todas as Pautas
GET {{baseUrl}}/pautas
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


### 1.3 Consultar Resultado da Votação de uma Pauta
GET {{baseUrl}}/pautas/{{pautaId}}/resultado
Content-Type: {{contentType}}


###############################################################################
# 2. SESSÕES DE VOTAÇÃO
###############################################################################

### 2.1 Abrir Sessão de Votação (Com tempo customizado - Ex: 3 minutos)
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessoes/abrir
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pautaId": {{pautaId}},
  "duracaoMinutos": 3
}

### 2.2 Abrir Sessão de Votação (Com tempo default - 1 minuto)
# Nota: Funciona apenas para pautas que ainda não possuem sessão aberta
POST {{baseUrl}}/sessoes/abrir
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pautaId": {{pautaId}}
}


###############################################################################
# 3. VOTOS
###############################################################################

### 3.1 Registrar Voto 'SIM' (Associado 1)
POST {{baseUrl}}/votos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pautaId": {{pautaId}},
  "associadoId": "12345678901",
  "voto": "SIM"
}

### 3.2 Registrar Voto 'NAO' (Associado 2)
POST {{baseUrl}}/votos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pautaId": {{pautaId}},
  "associadoId": "98765432100",
  "voto": "NAO"
}

### 3.3 Registrar Voto 'SIM' (Associado 3)
POST {{baseUrl}}/votos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pautaId": {{pautaId}},
  "associadoId": "11122233344",
  "voto": "SIM"
}


###############################################################################
# 4. CENÁRIOS DE ERRO E VALIDAÇÃO
###############################################################################

### 4.1 Tentativa de Voto Duplicado pelo Mesmo Associado (Deve retornar HTTP 400 ou 409)
POST {{baseUrl}}/votos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pautaId": {{pautaId}},
  "associadoId": "12345678901",
  "voto": "NAO"
}

### 4.2 Enviar Voto sem Campos Obrigatórios (Deve retornar HTTP 400 com mapa de erros)
POST {{baseUrl}}/votos
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

{
  "pautaId": {{pautaId}}
}

### 4.3 Consultar Pauta Inexistente (Deve retornar HTTP 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pautas/999999/resultado
Content-Type: {{contentType}}

### 5. Listar Todas as Sessões de Votação
GET {{baseUrl}}/sessoes
Accept: application/json

###